The Ashgrove plant enters the power and HVAC remediation shutdown on Wednesday 2026-05-27 and the lines go dark for three weeks. The change owner has written that the manifold cut-in can be advanced up to 7 days, so the last production day we can cut it in is Tuesday 2026-05-26. The current reservation is RES-33160 on 2026-05-29.

Folake has approved a re-certification order under AP-DO-0107; Northbank's confirmation RQ-3340 is attached.

The old ECO-23980 is still visible in the tracker — its scope is superseded; please check the live certificates.

